 body+='<h2>Reproducibility and provenance</h2><p>Seed 20261113. Numerical outputs are stored in results.json, including split row indices, prediction-level records, dataset hashes, intervals, and environment versions. The source package includes the analysis protocol, fitting code, figure code, this report, and source attribution. Run the supplied commands to reproduce the analysis. Parameters were fixed before evaluation; an independent audit corrected augmentation weights and all-column indicators before interpreting results.</p>'
 body+='<h2>References</h2><ol>'+''.join(f'<li><a href="{refs[k][1]}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{html.escape(refs[k][0])}</a></li>' for k in d['references'])+'</ol><p class="paper-meta">Dataset and method sources checked November 13, 2026. The analyses above are original computations on released data; they are not published findings from the cited studies.</p></main><footer><a href="./">Back to the experiments ↗</a><a href="../../">Back to projects ↗</a></footer></body></html>'
